repair = "Address, offset, valueSize and getter comments describe the first referenced raw byte and its exact span without a length prefix. Real V3 segment writes, persisted key-file decoding, Address serialization and both production readers prove primary, secondary alias, subrange and empty-end extents across two shards after reopen. Truncation fixtures prove that an extent ending exactly at EOF is readable and that a missing referenced byte fails."
